{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2019a.q29.material.recovered", "text": "阅读下列材料，按要求完成教学设计任务。 植物细胞在不同浓度的溶液中状态各不相同，当外界溶液浓度大于细胞液浓度时，细胞失水，呈现出质壁分离现象。学生在观察洋葱鳞片叶表皮细胞的质壁分离现象时，发现若将洋葱鳞片叶表皮细胞浸泡在0.3g/mL蔗糖溶液中时，能够观察到明显的质壁分离现象。 接下来，教师向学生提出进一步的思考问题“洋葱鳞片叶表皮细胞的平均细胞液浓度是多少呢？” 教师要求学生利用实验台上的材料和器具开展研究，以回答上述问题。 材料和器具包括紫色的洋葱鳞片叶、解剖刀、镊子、滴管、载玻片、盖玻片、移液管、试管、吸水纸、显微镜、质量浓度为0.3g/mL的蔗糖溶液、清水。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "ce22d5f93be816115ca628b6e6777aa3837f5b0fea2fa2014ac7418a5d97b1e8", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 5614, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5900, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 29, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "ce22d5f93be816115ca628b6e6777aa3837f5b0fea2fa2014ac7418a5d97b1e8"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2019a.q29"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s1.k07", "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s1.k10", "ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.408.r001", "ntce.outline.408.r018", "ntce.outline.408.r019", "ntce.outline.408.r020"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.shengwu.2019a.q29"], "word_count": 286, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "shengwu", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019年上半年教师资格证考试《高中生物》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "ce22d5f93be816115ca628b6e6777aa3837f5b0fea2fa2014ac7418a5d97b1e8", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 5614, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5900, "next_source_question_number": 30, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_wit